      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030205011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这样啊，我有才能吗。/n也就是说，靠演戏有可能养活自己，对吧？",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10302050100",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 110,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030205012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "星探",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我可以保证。虽然薪酬比不上大剧团，/n但你的人生一定会因此更丰富。所以——",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10302050110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030205013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030205,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "既然这样，要把才能卖给哪里，就由我自己选。",
      "WindowEffect": 1,
      "VoiceFileName": "10302050120",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 70,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
